#: ../../webinterface.rst:3
msgid "The Nextcloud web interface"
msgstr "Comhéadan gréasáin Nextcloud"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:5
msgid ""
"Open your Nextcloud server's URL in any web browser and log in with your "
"account name (or email address) and password:"
msgstr ""
"Oscail URL do fhreastalaí Nextcloud in aon bhrabhsálaí gréasáin agus logáil "
"isteach le hainm do chuntais (nó do sheoladh ríomhphoist) agus do "
"phasfhocal:"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:7
msgid "Nextcloud login screen."
msgstr "Scáileán logáil isteach Nextcloud."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:10
msgid ""
"You can also log in using a passkey or hardware security key by clicking "
"**Log in with a device**."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat logáil isteach freisin trí úsáid a bhaint as eochair phas nó "
"eochair shlándála crua-earraí, trí chliceáil ar **Logáil isteach le gléas**."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:13
msgid "Web browser requirements"
msgstr "Riachtanais bhrabhsálaí gréasáin"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:15
msgid ""
"For the best experience, use the latest version of one of these browsers:"
msgstr ""
"Chun an taithí is fearr a fháil, bain úsáid as an leagan is déanaí de cheann"
" de na brabhsálaithe seo:"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:17
msgid "Google **Chrome** / Chromium"
msgstr "Google **Chrome** / Chromium"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:18
msgid "Mozilla **Firefox**"
msgstr "Mozilla **Firefox**"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:19
msgid "Apple **Safari**"
msgstr "Apple **Safari**"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:20
msgid "Microsoft **Edge**"
msgstr "Microsoft **Edge**"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:22
msgid ""
"Not all versions are supported. Nextcloud targets `browsers meeting the "
"minimum usage threshold "
"<https://browserslist.dev/?q=PjAuMjUlLCBub3Qgb3BfbWluaSBhbGwsIG5vdCBkZWFkLCBGaXJlZm94IEVTUg==>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le gach leagan. Díríonn Nextcloud ar bhrabhsálaithe a "
"shásaíonn an tairseach íosta úsáide "
"<https://browserslist.dev/?q=PjAuMjUlLCBub3Qgb3BfbWluaSBhbGwsIG5vdCBkZWFkLCBGaXJlZm94IEVTUg==>`_."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:25
msgid "The Dashboard"
msgstr "An Deais"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:27
msgid ""
"After logging in, Nextcloud opens the **Dashboard** — a customisable "
"overview of your most important activity: upcoming calendar events, unread "
"messages, recent files, and more."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis logáil isteach, osclaíonn Nextcloud an **Painéal** — forbhreathnú "
"inoiriúnaithe ar an ngníomhaíocht is tábhachtaí atá agat: imeachtaí féilire "
"atá le teacht, teachtaireachtaí nár léadh, comhaid le déanaí, agus "
"tuilleadh."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:29
msgid "The Nextcloud Dashboard showing a personalised greeting and widgets."
msgstr ""
"Deais Nextcloud ina dtaispeántar beannacht phearsantaithe agus giuirléidí."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:32
msgid ""
"Use the **Customise** button at the bottom of the page to add, remove, or "
"rearrange widgets to suit your workflow."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an cnaipe **Saincheap** ag bun an leathanaigh chun giuirléidí a chur "
"leis, a bhaint, nó a athshocrú, de réir mar a oireann do do shreabhadh "
"oibre."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:35
msgid "Navigating the interface"
msgstr "Ag nascleanúint an chomhéadain"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:37
msgid "The navigation bar at the top of every page is your main access point:"
msgstr ""
"Is é an barra nascleanúna ag barr gach leathanaigh an príomhphointe rochtana"
" agat:"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:39
msgid ""
"The Nextcloud navigation bar with the logo, app shortcuts, and action icons."
msgstr ""
"Barra nascleanúna Nextcloud, ina bhfuil an lógó, aicearraí aipeanna, agus "
"deilbhíní gníomhaíochta."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:42
msgid "The **Nextcloud logo** (top left) takes you back to the Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Tugann **lógó Nextcloud** (sa chúinne uachtarach ar chlé) ar ais go dtí an "
"Deais tú."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:43
msgid ""
"**App shortcuts** are shown next to the logo — click any icon to switch to "
"that app (Files, Calendar, Talk, and so on)."
msgstr ""
"Tá **aicearraí aipeanna** ar taispeáint in aice leis an lógó — cliceáil ar "
"dheilbhín ar bith chun aistriú chuig an aip sin (Comhaid, Féilire, Talk, "
"agus mar sin de)."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:44
msgid ""
"The **search icon** on the right opens :ref:`unified search <unified-"
"search>`, which searches across all your apps at once."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn an **deilbhín cuardaigh** ar dheis an :ref:`cuardach aontaithe "
"<unified-search>`, a dhéanann cuardach thar do chuid aipeanna go léir ag an "
"am céanna."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:45
msgid "The **bell icon** shows your notifications."
msgstr "Taispeánann an **deilbhín clog** do chuid fógraí."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:46
msgid ""
"The **contacts icon** lets you quickly look up and contact other users on "
"your server."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an **deilbhín teagmhálaithe** duit úsáideoirí eile ar do fhreastalaí"
" a aimsiú go tapa agus teagmháil a dhéanamh leo."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:47
msgid "Your **profile picture** (far right) opens the settings menu."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn do **phictiúr próifíle** (ar an bhfad ar dheis) an roghchlár "
"socruithe."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:49
msgid ""
"Each app also has its own **left sidebar** with filters and actions specific"
" to that app."
msgstr ""
"Tá a **barra taoibh ar chlé** féin ag gach aip freisin, ina bhfuil scagairí "
"agus gníomhartha a bhaineann go sonrach leis an aip sin."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:52
msgid "Settings and profile"
msgstr "Socruithe agus próifíl"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:54
msgid "Click your profile picture to access your account options:"
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar do phictiúr próifíle chun roghanna do chuntais a rochtain:"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:56
msgid ""
"The profile menu showing options for settings, status, appearance, and "
"logging out."
msgstr ""
"An roghchlár próifíle, ina dtaispeántar roghanna le haghaidh socruithe, "
"stádas, cuma, agus logáil amach."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:59
msgid "From this menu you can:"
msgstr "Ón roghchlár seo is féidir leat:"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:61
msgid "View and edit your profile"
msgstr "Féach ar do phróifíl agus cuir in eagar í"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:62
msgid "Set your online status"
msgstr "Socraigh do stádas ar líne"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:63
msgid "Change appearance and accessibility settings"
msgstr "Athraigh socruithe cuma agus inrochtaineachta"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:64
msgid "Open your personal :doc:`Settings <userpreferences>` page"
msgstr "Oscail do leathanach pearsanta :doc:`Socruithe <userpreferences>`"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:65
msgid "Access help and privacy information"
msgstr "Rochtain ar chabhair agus faisnéis phríobháideachais"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:66
msgid "Log out"
msgstr "Logáil amach"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:69
msgid "Unified search"
msgstr "Cuardach aontaithe"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:73
msgid ""
"Click the search icon in the navigation bar (or press :kbd:`Ctrl+F`) to open"
" the unified search modal:"
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar an deilbhín cuardaigh sa bharra nascleanúna (nó brúigh "
":kbd:`Ctrl+F`) chun an fhuinneog chuardaigh a oscailt:"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:75
msgid "The unified search modal with Places, Date, and People filters."
msgstr ""
"An módal cuardaigh aontaithe le scagairí le haghaidh Áiteanna, Dáta agus "
"Daoine."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:78
msgid ""
"Unified search looks across all your installed apps — files, calendar "
"events, messages, contacts, and more — at once. Results are grouped by app "
"so you can quickly see where a match was found."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an cuardach aontaithe cuardach ar fud na n-aipeanna go léir atá "
"suiteáilte agat — comhaid, imeachtaí féilire, teachtaireachtaí, "
"teagmhálaithe, agus eile — ar fad ag an am céanna. Déantar torthaí a "
"ghrúpáil de réir aipe, ionas gur féidir leat a fheiceáil go tapa cá "
"bhfuarthas an toradh comhoiriúnach."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:80
msgid "Use the filter chips to narrow results:"
msgstr "Úsáid na cnaipí scagaire chun torthaí a chúngú:"

#: ../../webinterface.rst:82
msgid ""
"**Places** — limit the search to a specific app, such as Files or Calendar."
msgstr ""
"**Áiteanna** — teorannaigh an cuardach d’aip ar leith, ar nós Comhaid nó "
"Féilire."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Date** — filter by time period (today, last 7 days, last 30 days, this "
"year, or a custom range)."
msgstr ""
"**Dáta** — scag de réir tréimhse ama (inniu, na 7 lá anuas, na 30 lá anuas, "
"i mbliana, nó raon saincheaptha)."

#: ../../webinterface.rst:84
msgid "**People** — show only results related to a specific person."
msgstr "**Daoine** — ná taispeáin ach torthaí a bhaineann le duine ar leith."
